WEBVTT

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:11.260
Cat Cafe

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:15.190
Why Shampoo have to
work with that one?

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:17.220
That's my line!

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.890
Hot Springs Resorts
Vacations

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.730
Don't be angry!

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.670
This is the Merchant's
Association's annual getaway!

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:28.970
The perfect planning committee
has to be Ucchan's and Cat Cafe!

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.340
Thank you in advance!

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.780
I wanted vacation with Ranma alone...

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:43.720
...in some quiet spot where
we can spend quality time!

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.500
First I gotta clear out the obstacles!

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.230
You the one who is obstacle!

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:04.710
Life has many impediments
to a happy ending.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:09.580
Think of this as work
experience, and be friends.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:17.880
This it! This is it!

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:19.790
Japan's Top 100 Haunted Spots.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:34.540
Natural Haunted Caves:
"The Tunnel of Lost Love"

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.040
Ladies and Gentlemen!

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:41.240
The main attraction for the
Merchant's Association Tour!

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:42.980
Natural Haunted Caves!

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.140
Haunted Caves?

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.850
It looks so refreshing.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:51.420
Is famous date spot.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:53.720
D-Date spot?

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:58.860
I take a trip with Shampoo,
and now we tour a cave together!

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:00.990
It's like a dream!

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:04.040
For a "date spot"
it's not exactly hopping.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:07.870
I think it's charming in
a rustic sort of way.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:09.910
You're so old-fashioned, Tendo!

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:11.910
I needn't hear that from you!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:13.010
Thank you!

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:14.880
I'm so afraid, Wanio!

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.210
I'll protect you, Kabako!

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.880
Come on in! Hand in hand,
cheek to cheek!

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:23.050
Admission is only ¥100
for each boy/girl couple.

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:27.390
What's that? You can't get
in unless you pair up?

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:31.020
Shampoo forget to check that part!

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:32.900
Akane!

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.590
Ranma!

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:39.070
Got no choice.
You two go together!

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:47.070
It's so scary, the girl must
cling to the man the whole trip.

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:50.280
I-I got no interest
in Akane clingin' to me.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.650
Me neither!
Just go in with somebody else!

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:54.950
Hey, good idea!

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.690
Mousse, come with me!

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:59.280
R-Really, Shampoo?

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:00.290
You hurry up!

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:04.960
Where am I?

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.060
Ryoga!

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:09.200
So there you are! Let's go in!

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:10.070
H-Hey, wait...

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.670
There they went!

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:16.710
No choice.

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:20.710
We must enter as lovers!
Shall we proceed, Akane Tendo?

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.650
Father, shall we go in?

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:30.520
Going into a haunted cave with
my daughter? I'm so embarrassed!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.490
It's ¥100 a pair, Kuno-baby.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:37.460
What's the use of passing
out before you go in?

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:42.970
Well, we're stuck with it.
Let's go in.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.430
Don't go doin' anythin' weird!

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:46.970
That's my line!

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:51.650
Those two are having such fun!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.980
Hey! Quit standing there.
Let's go in!

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:58.680
I'm scared even before I go in!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:05:59.410
Owchie!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.920
Good luck!
Do your best!

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:04.250
Have fun!

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.850
See ya!

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.820
Mistress Kodachi!
They have all gone in!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.700
How hurtful!

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:16.170
My elder brother is enjoying
himself behind my back!

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:17.970
Sasuke!

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:19.470
Yes, Ma'am!

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.480
Lend me ¥100!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:25.880
The Kuno family's only daughter
is making coldhearted demands!

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:26.710
What was that?

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:29.170
N-No! It's nothing!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:30.720
Thank you.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.790
Remember to pay me back!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.490
You appeared just in time!

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:40.790
What're you trying to do?
Dragging me in here like this!

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.830
Calm down! Just take a look at this!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.760
A guaranteed break-up!

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:49.530
The cursed date location:
The Tunnel of Lost Love?

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:52.400
Three true stories of failed love!

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:54.840
T-This is...

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:57.310
This is the Tunnel of Lost Love.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:06:59.740
I'm so scared, Shiruo!

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:05.080
I've heard that every couple
who risks the cave, breaks up!

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:06.450
Don't worry, Menko!

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:09.650
No ghosts in the world
can split our love apart!

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.220
Yo! Yo! Yo! Yo!

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:13.590
You're cute, baby!

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.820
What's with you guys?

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:17.520
Leave the girl and scram!

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:19.530
They're for real!

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.190
Forgive me, Menko!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:24.200
I hate you, Shiruo!

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:28.500
I see. What a frightening tunnel!

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:32.210
And the exit is the worst part!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.410
It's the exit!

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.070
We're all right, now!

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:40.750
Even if a couple survives
the tunnel, at the exit is...

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:43.980
Haven't you broken up yet?

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:48.690
You'll live unhappily ever after!

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.440
The stronger the couple's affection...

00:07:54.540 --> 00:08:01.370
...the stronger the curse,
until the relationship collapses!

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:05.500
The stronger
the couple's affection...

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:09.550
After this, the couple
doesn't stand a chance!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.940
Akane!

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:15.320
Ranma!

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:25.360
"Fifty years has man; Life is naught but
phantasms; Hail in a beggar's bowl."

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:27.330
Count me in!

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.470
You'll do it?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:34.340
Come at me with
everything you've got!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.880
Father, please calm down.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.950
I don't like this.
I hate ghosts and stuff.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:54.630
M'lady! Won't you be my love?

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:57.560
W-What is it?

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:00.030
There's a strange guy over there!

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:05.530
What are you sayin'?
There's nobody there!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:10.310
It's gone! Was it a real ghost?

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:13.470
Don't be an idiot. Let's go!

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:21.040
Excuse me, do you
have any toilet paper?

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:26.550
My wife deserted me!

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:29.860
I thought I was a good swimmer!

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:32.590
It was my first date!

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:44.870
What's all the yellin' for?

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.250
Didn't you see anything?

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.880
We were surrounded by
ghosts the whole time!

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:54.590
Why don't you just give in?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.180
If you're scared...

00:09:56.290 --> 00:10:00.490
"Ahh, Master Ranma!
Protect my poor, poor self!"

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.820
It's that simple.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:04.870
This isn't the time for...

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:07.800
...you to be making bad jokes!

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:12.470
You're so insensitive!

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:15.270
How stupid!
There's no such thing as gho...

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:20.040
Ranma darling!

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:25.650
How I've longed to see you,
Ranma darling!

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:30.190
I'm so afraid of the dark!
Please, accompany me!

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:31.990
T-This is scarier than ghosts!

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:34.550
Oh, no! Someone's interfering!

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:36.660
Hey, Kodachi!

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.060
What are you doing?

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.570
Get away from Ranma!

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.360
She get between Ranma and Akane!

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:44.870
She destroy our break-up plan!

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:46.800
Where are you going, Shampoo?

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:49.780
Get outta here!
Where did you come from?

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.070
Let me go!

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:54.310
Shampoo! What are you doing?

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.780
Your lover, Mousse, is right here!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:59.850
Your future husband! Your darling!

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:01.320
The only man for you...

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:02.250
Shut up!

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:05.550
Akane!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:08.460
This is stupid! I'm going home!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:09.990
A-Akane!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:12.760
Just go with whoever you like!

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:16.660
Oh, no! This is no time to fight!

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:18.170
Let me go, Sasuke!

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:19.430
Ryoga!

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:25.540
Akane, forgive me!

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:29.220
Bakusai Tenketsu!

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.380
Oh, no! A cave-in!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.890
Now the exit is the only way out!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.290
Okay, then...

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:44.160
...We'll wait for you outside!

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:45.360
Wait for me!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:46.090
Akane!

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:46.830
Let me go!

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:48.490
Man the forts!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:51.330
Who needs you anyway!

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:56.370
Wait, Shampoo! Your futur...

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:57.100
Your heart's...

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:57.840
Shut up!

00:11:57.910 --> 00:11:59.210
Your heart's desire...

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.220
Wait for me!

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.220
This is bad! We gotta lose her!

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:09.220
Please forgive me, Akane!

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:12.850
Right now I must gird my
heart and leave you behind!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:17.230
However, I do this for the
sake of our future happiness!

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:20.320
Wait for me, Ryoga!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.230
I beg of you!

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:33.380
I thought I'd be left behind.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:34.380
Akane!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:38.780
Please, Ryoga! Please, go with me!

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.680
I'm so scared!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.620
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:47.020
You can kill me now!

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:48.120
You idiot!

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:52.590
What's with Akane? She's
actin' so cute in front of Ryoga!

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:56.230
Now, let's go, Akane!

00:12:56.570 --> 00:13:00.770
That idiot! He's completely
forgotten the basics of the plan.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:04.540
How ridiculous!
Let's go, Shampoo, Ucchan.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:07.750
What's wrong?

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:17.220
I never thought I'd
be going with Cologne.

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.570
Watch out!

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:31.100
W-What am I doing?

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:34.270
Thank you, Kuno-baby!

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:38.180
Hang in there, Shampoo!

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:39.770
It's only a flesh wound.

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.080
Ranma darling.

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:47.580
I guess ignorance really is bliss.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:52.360
The ghosts don't attack us.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.560
Let's call them.
Try yodeling, "Hey Mr. Ghost!"

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:00.700
What's wrong, Ukyo?

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:03.200
I-It's my chronic stomach spasms.

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:06.800
That very bad!
Me and Ryoga look after her.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:08.900
Ranma and Akane go on ahead!

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:12.980
In that case,
I'll carry you piggyback.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.810
C'mon.

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:18.580
I'm so happy, Ranma-honey!

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:24.020
Geez! He's never so nice to me!

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:27.020
Let's go, Ryoga!

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:28.930
O-Okay!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:32.190
Hey!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:37.530
I see! You're offering to take
me piggyback, right? Thanks!

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:39.040
She seems healthy enough.

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:41.670
Ryoga!

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.470
Sorry! I forgot myself!

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:46.640
Leave the women behind!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:50.110
Look out, Akane!

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:55.990
Ryoga!

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:01.160
Ryoga!

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:01.990
Akane!

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.820
You don't understand anything!

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.900
What a wonderful world this is!

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:12.000
If only we could be
like this here forever!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:22.170
That's it! If we never
find the exit, Akane and I...

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.210
Honey! I'm so scared!

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:30.960
What'll I do with you?

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:37.260
That's it! I'll do it!

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.630
Hey! You wait!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.500
River Styx Boat Rental

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:49.510
Line up to cross the River Styx!

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.010
Over there!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:56.820
Akane! Leave this to me!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.620
This boat seems strange, Shampoo.

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:09.990
Sorry about that.

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:14.190
More than one passenger and
the boat is overloaded and sinks.

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:23.370
Limit One Passenger

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:27.640
Tsuruhiko! Please,
leave the boat, for my sake!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:32.650
What are you saying, Kameko!
We vowed to never be parted!

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:35.050
Get off my boat, you jerk!

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.650
Help me!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:40.060
Get off the boat!

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:44.560
What'll I do, Ryoga? I can't swim!

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.560
A-Akane!

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:55.170
Oh, no! If I leave the boat,
I can save Akane!

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:58.010
But, when I do...

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:02.480
...she'll discover that I'm P-chan!

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.250
Father!

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:09.760
Don't stop me, Kasumi!
If I stay aboard, you'll drown! Farewell!

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:15.800
Oh my! Oh my!

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.930
No! You idiot! What are you doin'?

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:26.370
Ryoga, that jerk!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:27.870
Aw, man! Wait up!

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:30.570
I must do what I must.

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:34.110
Nabiki Tendo, I will pay
you ¥5000 for the boat.

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:36.410
¥10,000.

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:39.380
Kuno-baby, you're pretty stingy.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.320
Don't just swim there!
Do something!

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:12.280
P-chan!

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:18.310
Father!

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:21.830
Oh, Kasumi! Nabiki!
You're both all right!

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:24.270
Non-Communal Baths

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.300
It's pretty inside!

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.930
Let's take our time.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:35.610
I hope Ryoga will catch up with us.

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:41.050
Quit that, Akane. If a man
abandons you, forget him.

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:45.680
Ranma-honey is the only
man you can rely on.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:51.190
But Ryoga is kinder, more reliable...

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:55.020
...honest, manly, and earnest.

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:58.960
I'm going to wait for Ryoga!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:07.270
That witch! I have to sit by
while she badmouths Ranma-honey.

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:09.870
U-Ukyo!

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:13.710
This is the hell of Boiling Water!

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:15.210
I think I'll pass.

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:17.110
Let's go on to the next exhibit!

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:23.120
Good for you, P-chan.
There's a public bath.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:29.150
A little longer and
I would have lost my mind.

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:32.360
Our real happiness
comes after the cursed exit...

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:34.590
...when Ranma and Akane break up!

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.830
Akane!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.240
Ranma!

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:43.070
Ranma! From here on out,
Akane is your responsibility!

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:44.500
Understand?

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:46.640
W-What do you mean?

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:50.810
Gosh, I'm cold!

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:53.080
Wow, that was so relaxing!

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:55.160
Why're you so late, Torako?

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:57.220
It's nothing to get mad about, Kumao!

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:58.690
Women's baths take time.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:19:59.420
What?

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:01.400
I'm not waiting for you anymore!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:03.400
You're going on ahead? That's awful!

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:04.190
We're through!

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.290
I guess so!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.930
There are a lot of couples arguin'.

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:11.010
So this is the dreaded
Tunnel of Lost Love.

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:14.610
Ryoga!

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:17.040
U-Ukyo! I'm sorr...

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:21.040
Just stay under your rock!

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:24.080
That's why I wanted to
apologize to you!

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:25.310
I'm sorry! Forgive me!

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:32.560
C'mon!

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:37.590
Ukyo is acting weird today.

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.530
Y'know, Ryoga is, too.

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:43.040
You don't suppose...

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:46.810
I won't be faithless anymore!

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:48.710
I just can't trust you!

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:52.940
But we can start over!

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:55.570
Do you really want to?

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:58.580
I knew it!

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:04.290
I'm sure of it!

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:06.920
Those two are...

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.620
...dating!

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:11.430
So that's it!

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:14.930
In any case, the exit is close by!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.470
We'll force them to leave as a couple!

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.930
Ranma! Make up with Aka...

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:26.170
You're hidin' things from me,
you sneak!

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:30.080
I'm sorry, Ukyo. I just didn't notice!

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.120
Let's go, Akane.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:33.080
Okay!

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:37.990
T-They made up!

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:40.060
W-What happened?

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:43.960
Those two got caught up in our fight.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.560
Shoulda been more careful.

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:08.010
T-This is...

00:22:08.120 --> 00:22:10.090
Look at that! It's the exit!

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:19.970
I-It's the final test of...

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:21.230
...a couple's courage!

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:24.570
Don't fall, Akane.

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:50.030
It's...

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:51.360
It's the wraiths!

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:54.700
These are the wraiths of couples
that broke up in this cave!

00:22:56.870 --> 00:22:58.030
Break up!

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:00.810
Break up!

00:23:05.810 --> 00:23:08.750
You poor fools!
Haven't you broken up yet?

00:23:08.850 --> 00:23:09.710
We'll break you up!

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:11.110
Break up!

00:23:12.150 --> 00:23:14.180
Akane! Don't let go!

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:16.450
Geez!

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:17.790
Break up!

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:19.780
No!

00:23:20.390 --> 00:23:21.420
It's started!

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:23.220
This is the end for them!

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:24.490
Break up!

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:25.660
You must break up!

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:30.630
Damn! Why are you attacking me?

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:33.270
You guys almost had it!

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:34.640
Get away from US!

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:38.540
We've got to get out!

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:42.510
Akane!

00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:44.510
Ranma!

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:46.210
Akane!

00:23:49.190 --> 00:23:50.920
That's the way!

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:52.720
Pull those two apart!

00:23:58.600 --> 00:23:59.400
Break up!

00:23:59.900 --> 00:24:01.430
Watch out, Ukyo!

00:24:03.600 --> 00:24:04.940
Ryoga, behind you!

00:24:09.410 --> 00:24:10.400
Thank you, Ukyo!

00:24:10.510 --> 00:24:12.640
Double for me!

00:24:13.150 --> 00:24:16.050
Damn! And the exit is so close!

00:24:18.050 --> 00:24:20.350
Akane! I'll take care
of these guys somehow!

00:24:21.220 --> 00:24:23.420
Go out the exit alone!

00:24:23.520 --> 00:24:27.360
I can't do that!
I'm a martial artist, too!

00:24:27.900 --> 00:24:32.390
You idiot! You'll just get
in my way! Leave them to me!

00:24:33.940 --> 00:24:36.730
What? You're so insensitive!

00:24:37.370 --> 00:24:40.030
You're always making
lovey faces at Ukyo!

00:24:40.140 --> 00:24:42.910
You're hangin'
all over Ryoga, you idiot!

00:24:44.610 --> 00:24:46.340
Who's an idiot? Who is?

00:24:46.450 --> 00:24:48.140
You are! You idiot!

00:24:48.250 --> 00:24:51.710
I'm mad now! I should never
have come here with you!

00:24:51.820 --> 00:24:55.120
That's what I was goin' to say!

00:24:56.620 --> 00:24:58.790
Break up!

00:24:59.930 --> 00:25:01.790
You're making a mistake!

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:03.790
We're not a couple!

00:25:03.870 --> 00:25:05.160
Liars!

00:25:05.270 --> 00:25:07.460
I'm so jealous!

00:25:08.600 --> 00:25:11.040
You're more of
a couple than those two!

00:25:12.210 --> 00:25:14.870
Exit

00:25:19.280 --> 00:25:24.410
I never thought the River Styx
would lead to a place like this!

00:25:25.890 --> 00:25:28.320
Cafe

00:25:28.960 --> 00:25:30.720
Hey, Mister, are
the sweet dumplings ready?

00:25:30.830 --> 00:25:31.880
Yes, sir!

00:25:31.990 --> 00:25:33.320
There they are!

00:25:44.440 --> 00:25:46.700
Ryoga! Hurry, over here!

00:25:46.810 --> 00:25:50.710
C'mon, Ukyo! They've got some
delicious shaved ice here!

00:25:50.810 --> 00:25:53.210
I'll keep your relationship
a secret for you!

00:25:53.310 --> 00:25:56.110
Get over here and pig out!

00:25:56.220 --> 00:25:58.410
I'm in trouble!
